<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian crude oil, gas output rises in Dec.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian crude oil, gas output rises in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Department of Primary Industries and Energy issued the following data for Australia's petroleum production on Monday:</p>
<p>		 Crude Oil  Condensate	Total    Total '000 bpd</p>
<p>			 (megalitres)</p>
<p>Dec 96	   2,351.5	582.0	2,933.4	  595.2</p>
<p>Nov 96	   2,038.8	506.2	2,545.0	  533.6</p>
<p>Dec 95	   1,846.3	519.5	2,365.8	  480.0</p>
<p>Fiscal 95/96  24,085.2    6,193.3     30,278.4	  521.8</p>
<p>Fiscal 94/95  26,795.0    4,394.5     31,189.6	  537.5</p>
<p>Calendar 96   25,270.0    6,308.1     31,578.1	  544.2</p>
<p>Calendar 95   24,168.5    5,480.7     29,649.2	  510.9</p>
<p>December percentage change on year-to-date:</p>
<p>Fiscal	    10.3	  3.6	   8.8		n/a</p>
<p>Calendar	   4.6	 15.1	   6.5		n/a</p>
<p>	     Liquefied Petroleum Gas* Ethane	Natural Gas</p>
<p>(megalitres) (million cubic metres)</p>
<p>Dec 96		286.9		  13.8	   2,409.5</p>
<p>Nov 96		278.8		   9.4	   2,401.2</p>
<p>Dec 95		313.9		  13.4	   2,406.4</p>
<p>Fiscal 95/96    3,649.4		 186.5	  29,984.9</p>
<p>Fiscal 94/95    3,608.8		 203.0	  29,207.6</p>
<p>Calendar 96     3,717.0		 180.7	  29,798.2</p>
<p>Calendar 95     3,519.1		 191.3	  29,802.1</p>
<p>December percentage change on year-to-date:</p>
<p>Fiscal		 3.8		    -6.3	    -1.2</p>
<p>Calendar	     5.6		    -5.5	     0.0</p>
<p>NOTE: * Naturally occurring LPG. One megalitre equals 6,290 barrels.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
